---
title:    "Putting Declarative Programming into the Web: Translating Curry to JavaScript"
citation: "(PPDP 2007)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/PPDP07.html"
date:     2007-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper presents a technique to compile Curry programs
into JavaScript programs in order to check specific input conditions in the web browser,
where the programmer can implement these conditions in Curry.
The implementation is available in the
[Curry package wui](https://cpm.curry-lang.org/pkgs/wui.html).
